  "description": "XUGKAN crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C244 H328 N14 Nd10 O49 P4 2+,C88 H110 O8 2-,8(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd5 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd6 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd7 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd8 (Nd) has 9 O neighbors; Nd9 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd10 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd5'? (Nd) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 21 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.708-5.416 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.30-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd10(TBC8A)2(PhPO3)4(OH)2(HCO3)(HCOO)(DMF)14]·(H6TBC8A)·8CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
